<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transportation in Ankleshwar GIDC Gujarat | Covered Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad guarantee that my car arrives without scratches during transport from Ankleshwar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ hydraulic ramp trailers equipped with soft‑rubber rollers and anti‑scratch wheel chocks. Each vehicle is wrapped in our 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging before loading, and trained technicians perform a pre‑ and post‑trip inspection. The zero‑scratch guarantee is backed by full‑coverage insurance, ensuring any damage is promptly compensated.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for IBA‑approved GST billing for car transportation in Ankleshwar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Clients must provide a valid GSTIN, a signed transport agreement, vehicle registration copy, and a government‑issued identity proof. Our team also prepares an e‑Way bill for interstate moves. These documents enable IBA‑approved GST invoices, which are accepted for central, state, PSU, and corporate reimbursement claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time while it moves from Ankleshwar to major hubs?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every truck is fitted with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that streams live location data to our client portal. You receive instant alerts for departure, checkpoints, and arrival, along with estimated time‑of‑arrival updates. This transparency ensures peace of mind throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for car shifting services, and what does the coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While insurance is optional, we strongly recommend it because it protects against accidental damage, theft, and natural events. Our IRDAI‑approved policy offers 100 % declared value coverage, covering repair costs, total loss, and liability for any third‑party claims during transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are hydraulic ramp trailers different from traditional open carriers for car transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramp trailers feature a motorized, low‑profile ramp that gently lifts the vehicle onto an enclosed, climate‑controlled deck, eliminating exposure to road debris and weather. Traditional open carriers lack this protection, increasing the risk of scratches, dents, and weather‑related wear during long hauls.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the typical transit time for an 850 km journey from Ankleshwar to Delhi using Shree Ashirwad’s services?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Under normal traffic conditions, our dedicated multi‑axle express freight highways allow the shipment to reach Delhi within 14‑16 hours door‑to‑door. We factor in loading, customs documentation (if any), and scheduled rest stops to ensure timely and safe delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you provide car transport on train as an alternative to road shipping from Ankleshwar?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, we coordinate with Indian Railways to offer car transport on train for clients seeking rail logistics. This service includes door‑to‑door pickup, secure rail‑car loading, and final delivery. While rail can be cost‑effective for bulk moves, road transport remains faster for time‑sensitive shipments.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
